essed via", "x0": 0.3802197802197802, "y0": 0.7637917637917638, "x1": 0.6307692307692307, "y1": 0.7731157731157731}, {"text": "NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.26043956043956046, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.6043956043956044, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}], [{"text": "9287310054 |", "x0": 0.7769230769230769, "y0": 0.037296037296037296, "x1": 0.9307692307692308, "y1": 0.059052059052059055}, {"text": "Question 2 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "How do we know that the father\u2019s \u2018master plan\u2019 was effective?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.6296703296703297, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "Question 3 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.2789432789432789, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.2913752913752914}, {"text": "What is the effect of the pauses in Tim\u2019s talk?", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.3123543123543124, "x1": 0.49340659340659343, "y1": 0.32556332556332557}, {"text": "Question 4 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4763014763014763, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.4887334887334887}, {"text": "Explain the significance of Tim\u2019s relationship with his grandmother.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5097125097125097, "x1": 0.6736263736263737, "y1": 0.5229215229215229}, {"text": "Please turn over", "x0": 0.42967032967032964, "y0": 0.7474747474747475, "x1": 0.5692307692307692, "y1": 0.7575757575757576}, {"text": "NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.26043956043956046, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.6043956043956044, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}], [{"text": "Question 5 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "How does Tim convey his regret at rejecting the Brisbane Bullets\u2019 offer?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.710989010989011, "y1": 0.